(7432555, 1174598, 6519, '<td valign="top">I am not voting in this challenge, but this is NOT a silhouette..... it is merely an under-exposed photo of a (otherwise lovely) horse photo.</td>', 'I am not voting in this challenge, but this is NOT a silhouette..... it is merely an under-exposed photo of a (otherwise lovely) horse photo.', '2016-01-28 03:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
