(7432964, 1174550, 45631, '<td valign="top">There is too much light on the daffodils for this to meet the challenge for me.  Everything should be fully black.</td>', 'There is too much light on the daffodils for this to meet the challenge for me.  Everything should be fully black.', '2016-01-29 06:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432966, 1174621, 45631, '<td valign="top">The liquid in the cup is the subject of this silhouette but there is light coming through it and giving detail so for me it does not meet the silhouette challenge.</td>', 'The liquid in the cup is the subject of this silhouette but there is light coming through it and giving detail so for me it does not meet the silhouette challenge.', '2016-01-29 06:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432967, 1174547, 45631, '<td valign="top">The two women walking in this image appear to be the subject but they have lighting on them giving shape and form,.  For me this image does not meet the silhouette challenge.</td>', 'The two women walking in this image appear to be the subject but they have lighting on them giving shape and form,.  For me this image does not meet the silhouette challenge.', '2016-01-29 06:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432969, 1174256, 45631, '<td valign="top">An image of a silhouette needs to be interesting.  If a person was a silhouette standing sideways there would not be much to look at but if the person was standing front on with the legs apart and their arms wide open you would now have a more interesting silhouette.  Look for silhouettes that create interest and impact.</td>', 'An image of a silhouette needs to be interesting.  If a person was a silhouette standing sideways there would not be much to look at but if the person was standing front on with the legs apart and their arms wide open you would now have a more interesting silhouette.  Look for silhouettes that create interest and impact.', '2016-01-29 06:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432970, 1174597, 45631, '<td valign="top">The people in the background are partly silhouetted but the subject of the image is in the light.  For me this image doesn''t meet the challenge of ''Silhouette''</td>', 'The people in the background are partly silhouetted but the subject of the image is in the light.  For me this image doesn''t meet the challenge of ''Silhouette''', '2016-01-29 06:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432971, 1174515, 45631, '<td valign="top">This is more of a landscape scene and whilst the mount in the background is black it doesn''t create a great deal of interest.  I find the foreground area being lit is a distraction to the image so for me a higher crop would have worked better for this image.</td>', 'This is more of a landscape scene and whilst the mount in the background is black it doesn''t create a great deal of interest.  I find the foreground area being lit is a distraction to the image so for me a higher crop would have worked better for this image.', '2016-01-29 06:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432972, 1174557, 45631, '<td valign="top">I think this image could have worked well for this challenge if it had been cropped about a third higher and been exposed the create a better silhouette or levels adjusted to enhance the exposure.  There is a lot of noise in the image which could be from the exposure or that it has been heavily cropped.</td>', 'I think this image could have worked well for this challenge if it had been cropped about a third higher and been exposed the create a better silhouette or levels adjusted to enhance the exposure.  There is a lot of noise in the image which could be from the exposure or that it has been heavily cropped.', '2016-01-29 06:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432973, 1174527, 45631, '<td valign="top">For me this is an image of a black dog and I don''t find it to meet the silhouette challenge.</td>', 'For me this is an image of a black dog and I don''t find it to meet the silhouette challenge.', '2016-01-29 06:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432974, 1174479, 45631, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting image but it doesn''t meet the Silhouette challenge for me.  Detail is visible on the rider and he should instead by totally black. I love the shadow on the ground but it is also not a silhouette.<br/> <br/>I like the sun rays in this but would probably crop it above the white strips at the bottom to make a more solid image.</td>', 'This is an interesting image but it doesn''t meet the Silhouette challenge for me.  Detail is visible on the rider and he should instead by totally black. I love the shadow on the ground but it is also not a silhouette. I like the sun rays in this but would probably crop it above the white strips at the bottom to make a more solid image.', '2016-01-29 06:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432975, 1174587, 45631, '<td valign="top">The main subject of this is the moon and there is no silhouetted items of interest in the foreground.  The images is also out of focus.</td>', 'The main subject of this is the moon and there is no silhouetted items of interest in the foreground.  The images is also out of focus.', '2016-01-29 06:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432978, 1174476, 45631, '<td valign="top">Nice image but doesn''t meet the challenge for me.  The tree should be black and no detail should be seen in the trunk etc.</td>', 'Nice image but doesn''t meet the challenge for me.  The tree should be black and no detail should be seen in the trunk etc.', '2016-01-29 06:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432979, 1174362, 45631, '<td valign="top">Silhouette<br/>A silhouette is the image of a person, animal, object or scene represented as a solid shape of a single color, usually black, its edges matching the outline of the subject.</td>', 'SilhouetteA silhouette is the image of a person, animal, object or scene represented as a solid shape of a single color, usually black, its edges matching the outline of the subject.', '2016-01-29 06:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432980, 1174395, 45631, '<td valign="top">For me this is not a silhouette but an image with rim lighting.</td>', 'For me this is not a silhouette but an image with rim lighting.', '2016-01-29 06:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432981, 1174606, 45631, '<td valign="top">I love this image but it doesn''t meet the silhouette challenge for me. I would like the man to be more of a silhouette.  Great story though.</td>', 'I love this image but it doesn''t meet the silhouette challenge for me. I would like the man to be more of a silhouette.  Great story though.', '2016-01-29 06:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432983, 1174584, 45631, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately there is too much light on the castle for this to be a silhouette for me. If it had been solid black I don''t know that this subject would have worked well for the challenge as it doesn''t have enough shape to the building to make it interesting. That being said I''m sure this a a great image with the right light on it.</td>', 'Unfortunately there is too much light on the castle for this to be a silhouette for me. If it had been solid black I don''t know that this subject would have worked well for the challenge as it doesn''t have enough shape to the building to make it interesting. That being said I''m sure this a a great image with the right light on it.', '2016-01-29 06:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7432984, 1174623, 45631, '<td valign="top">I don''t find this image working for me for this challenge.</td>', 'I don''t find this image working for me for this challenge.', '2016-01-29 06:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
