(7433551, 1174556, 47974, '<td valign="top">Not really understanding this photograph, there is no clearly defined subject.  I am guessing it is the finger and it is a silhouette as are the bushes/tree to the left.  I have to force my eye to see the finger, it acts as a guide to the trees for me, which are blurry.........</td>', 'Not really understanding this photograph, there is no clearly defined subject.  I am guessing it is the finger and it is a silhouette as are the bushes/tree to the left.  I have to force my eye to see the finger, it acts as a guide to the trees for me, which are blurry.........', '2016-01-31 17:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7433552, 1174615, 47974, '<td valign="top">The yellow background is off putting, really distract from the subject to me.  Would have preferred the bottom part cropped out as the round objects on the bottom are distracting.</td>', 'The yellow background is off putting, really distract from the subject to me.  Would have preferred the bottom part cropped out as the round objects on the bottom are distracting.', '2016-01-31 17:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
