(7433554, 1174548, 47974, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done and love that it is in black and white.  Only two complaints from me, the little object to the left along the ground (should have edited it out) and the bird on the right (should have edited it out).</td>', 'Very nicely done and love that it is in black and white.  Only two complaints from me, the little object to the left along the ground (should have edited it out) and the bird on the right (should have edited it out).', '2016-01-31 17:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7433556, 1174441, 47974, '<td valign="top">Great black and white silhouette, just wish that arrow was not there.  It is a bit distracting and draws my eye to the bright lights and forces my eye to the right where there is just black with nothing to lead me into the photograph.</td>', 'Great black and white silhouette, just wish that arrow was not there.  It is a bit distracting and draws my eye to the bright lights and forces my eye to the right where there is just black with nothing to lead me into the photograph.', '2016-01-31 17:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
