(7433560, 1174362, 61396, '<td valign="top">intriguing</td>', 'intriguing', '2016-01-31 17:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7433561, 1174587, 47974, '<td valign="top">Really not sure what the silhouette is, I guess the trees or what ever it is that I cannot see.  Would really prefer the subject be the silhouette and in this case it is the blurry moon or is it the sun?</td>', 'Really not sure what the silhouette is, I guess the trees or what ever it is that I cannot see.  Would really prefer the subject be the silhouette and in this case it is the blurry moon or is it the sun?', '2016-01-31 17:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7433564, 1174606, 47974, '<td valign="top">There is no real clear subject in the photograph, is it the person in the bed or the guy with the knife?  For me, the silhouette should be the subject and it should be clear that it is the subject.  There is also a little to much light and visible detail in the knife guy to be a true silhouette.</td>', 'There is no real clear subject in the photograph, is it the person in the bed or the guy with the knife?  For me, the silhouette should be the subject and it should be clear that it is the subject.  There is also a little to much light and visible detail in the knife guy to be a true silhouette.', '2016-01-31 17:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7433565, 1174538, 47974, '<td valign="top">This really is more a dark photograph then a silhouette.  Yes the tree and to some extent the building is in silhouette but a true silhouette should be against a brighter background and yours is just marginally brighter.</td>', 'This really is more a dark photograph then a silhouette.  Yes the tree and to some extent the building is in silhouette but a true silhouette should be against a brighter background and yours is just marginally brighter.', '2016-01-31 17:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7433566, 1174568, 47974, '<td valign="top">You can not argue, this is most defiantly a silhouette.  The background is just to over the top for me and I forget about the guy with the flag and my eye zeros in on that bright white spot.  Would have been a much better photograph if the person was a bit larger in the frame and not what to me is more of a small after thought.</td>', 'You can not argue, this is most defiantly a silhouette.  The background is just to over the top for me and I forget about the guy with the flag and my eye zeros in on that bright white spot.  Would have been a much better photograph if the person was a bit larger in the frame and not what to me is more of a small after thought.', '2016-01-31 17:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7433570, 1174473, 47974, '<td valign="top">Really great capture and good example of what a silhouette should be.  Love the color of the sky and the fine intricate shapes that the tree branches form.</td>', 'Really great capture and good example of what a silhouette should be.  Love the color of the sky and the fine intricate shapes that the tree branches form.', '2016-01-31 17:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7433571, 1174583, 47974, '<td valign="top">To me this is more just a dark photograph.  A silhouette should be a shape or outline against a brighter background.  Your background is marginally brighter in most of the areas, with only the small area to the right being significantly brighter.....this really makes the overall photograph to dark for my taste.</td>', 'To me this is more just a dark photograph.  A silhouette should be a shape or outline against a brighter background.  Your background is marginally brighter in most of the areas, with only the small area to the right being significantly brighter.....this really makes the overall photograph to dark for my taste.', '2016-01-31 17:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7433576, 1174588, 47974, '<td valign="top">Interesting in a very abstract way, like how the silhouettes have shadows/silhouettes of their own.</td>', 'Interesting in a very abstract way, like how the silhouettes have shadows/silhouettes of their own.', '2016-01-31 17:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7433577, 1174623, 47974, '<td valign="top">I am guessing that your silhouette is the little statue or what ever it is at the top of the building against the moon.  I only noticed it because I was looking for the silhouette because that is what the challenge is.  I really should not have to search that hard to see if the photograph even meets the challenge and for me the silhouette should be the subject of the photograph, not some tiny insignificant part.</td>', 'I am guessing that your silhouette is the little statue or what ever it is at the top of the building against the moon.  I only noticed it because I was looking for the silhouette because that is what the challenge is.  I really should not have to search that hard to see if the photograph even meets the challenge and for me the silhouette should be the subject of the photograph, not some tiny insignificant part.', '2016-01-31 17:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7433578, 1174526, 47974, '<td valign="top">Wonderful and perfect capture of a silhouette.  To bad you did not blow out the object at the top so it was just solid white like they were running into the light.  I do find that fence a bit distracting from the overall photograph.</td>', 'Wonderful and perfect capture of a silhouette.  To bad you did not blow out the object at the top so it was just solid white like they were running into the light.  I do find that fence a bit distracting from the overall photograph.', '2016-01-31 17:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7433579, 1174236, 47974, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette but would really have preferred a brighter background to make it stand out even more, it gets lost at the top where the sky is really dark and my eye wants to stay focused on the bright area in the middle.</td>', 'Nice silhouette but would really have preferred a brighter background to make it stand out even more, it gets lost at the top where the sky is really dark and my eye wants to stay focused on the bright area in the middle.', '2016-01-31 17:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7433580, 1174515, 47974, '<td valign="top">This is just a dark photograph that has the sun as the subject and some hill that is in silhouette.  Given the challenge I wanted to see the silhouette as the subject and in this case it is not.</td>', 'This is just a dark photograph that has the sun as the subject and some hill that is in silhouette.  Given the challenge I wanted to see the silhouette as the subject and in this case it is not.', '2016-01-31 17:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
