(7433584, 1174595, 47974, '<td valign="top">I really like the photograph but for me a silhouette is against a light background. I will say it is one of the more interesting ones in the challenge but for me it is just not a silhouette.  Great photograph but for me DMNC.</td>', 'I really like the photograph but for me a silhouette is against a light background. I will say it is one of the more interesting ones in the challenge but for me it is just not a silhouette.  Great photograph but for me DMNC.', '2016-01-31 18:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
