(7433608, 1174621, 47974, '<td valign="top">Very interesting take on the challenge.  I am still trying to decide if it is a silhouette as the shape is not really meaningful like a person or a dog or bird etc.  Nice photograph tho.</td>', 'Very interesting take on the challenge.  I am still trying to decide if it is a silhouette as the shape is not really meaningful like a person or a dog or bird etc.  Nice photograph tho.', '2016-01-31 19:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
