(7433622, 1174610, 114285, '<td valign="top">I know I know, that you had no say in where those awkward little monoliths were placed, but  this would''ve been excellent if they were not there.   Nevertheless a nice balanced image.</td>', 'I know I know, that you had no say in where those awkward little monoliths were placed, but  this would''ve been excellent if they were not there.   Nevertheless a nice balanced image.', '2016-01-31 19:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7433623, 1174598, 47974, '<td valign="top">The horse has to much detail in it for me as a silhouette.  The definition for silhouette is "the dark shape and outline of someone or something visible against a lighter background, especially in dim light" and for me a sharp or outline has no detail and is just a that.......a shape that from that shape I can determine what it is.</td>', 'The horse has to much detail in it for me as a silhouette.  The definition for silhouette is "the dark shape and outline of someone or something visible against a lighter background, especially in dim light" and for me a sharp or outline has no detail and is just a that.......a shape that from that shape I can determine what it is.', '2016-01-31 19:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7433624, 1174476, 47974, '<td valign="top">What is your silhouette?  The definition for silhouette is "the dark shape and outline of someone or something visible against a lighter background, especially in dim light" and for me a shape means no detail....just that.....a dark sharp with no detail.</td>', 'What is your silhouette?  The definition for silhouette is "the dark shape and outline of someone or something visible against a lighter background, especially in dim light" and for me a shape means no detail....just that.....a dark sharp with no detail.', '2016-01-31 19:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7433625, 1174597, 47974, '<td valign="top">The people in the background are a silhouette but the subject is not.  I really wanted the subject to be the silhouette, it looks more like you took this photo and then realized "I got the perfect shoehorn"</td>', 'The people in the background are a silhouette but the subject is not.  I really wanted the subject to be the silhouette, it looks more like you took this photo and then realized "I got the perfect shoehorn"', '2016-01-31 19:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
