(7433772, 1174487, 175821, '<td valign="top">I noticed that too. However, it didn''t bother me much. I felt the elk on the left, being patricianly obstructed was more of a distraction than their rear ends!<br/> <br/>I gave it a 7.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> This is not a true  silhouetted image. I can see the middle ones backside quite clearly :-)    Not to mention the other two also.  I would of  darkened Image more.  Voted earlier. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'I noticed that too. However, it didn''t bother me much. I felt the elk on the left, being patricianly obstructed was more of a distraction than their rear ends! I gave it a 7. Originally posted by Neat: This is not a true  silhouetted image. I can see the middle ones backside quite clearly :-)    Not to mention the other two also.  I would of  darkened Image more.  Voted earlier. ', '2016-02-01 00:17:14.000000', NULL, 0),
