(7433904, 1174526, 147314, '<td valign="top">Great take on the challenge. Normally you can expect some comments about the washed out part on the top, but here it is just perfect. Congrats on the HM!.</td>', 'Great take on the challenge. Normally you can expect some comments about the washed out part on the top, but here it is just perfect. Congrats on the HM!.', '2016-02-01 11:30:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(7433909, 1174487, 147314, '<td valign="top">Sorry Richard, I''m with Anita in this. Looking for a definition of a silhouette I found this on Wikipedia: <i>A silhouette is the image of a person, animal, object or scene represented as a solid shape of a single color, usually black, its edges matching the outline of the subject. <u>The interior of a silhouette is featureless</u>, and the whole is typically presented on a light background, usually white, or none at all.</i>. Maybe there are more definitions, but that does not make her comment ridiculous. I think she is entitled to say what she thinks, that''s the whole purpose of giving comments.<br/>Congrats with a beautiful image of these impressive elks and with the Yellow!</td>', 'Sorry Richard, I''m with Anita in this. Looking for a definition of a silhouette I found this on Wikipedia: A silhouette is the image of a person, animal, object or scene represented as a solid shape of a single color, usually black, its edges matching the outline of the subject. The interior of a silhouette is featureless, and the whole is typically presented on a light background, usually white, or none at all.. Maybe there are more definitions, but that does not make her comment ridiculous. I think she is entitled to say what she thinks, that''s the whole purpose of giving comments.Congrats with a beautiful image of these impressive elks and with the Yellow!', '2016-02-01 11:37:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(7433912, 1174487, 54446, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Kroburg:</b></div><hr/><i> Sorry Richard, I''m with Anita in this. Looking for a definition of a silhouette I found this on Wikipedia: <i>A silhouette is the image of a person, animal, object or scene represented as a solid shape of a single color, usually black, its edges matching the outline of the subject. <u>The interior of a silhouette is featureless</u>, and the whole is typically presented on a light background, usually white, or none at all.</i>. Maybe there are more definitions, but that does not make her comment ridiculous. I think she is entitled to say what she thinks, that''s the whole purpose of giving comments.<br/>Congrats with a beautiful image of these impressive elks and with the Yellow! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Your definition and Neat''s definition are much more narrow than intended by the original challenge description.   A natural looking silhouette is not often pure black, unless doctored in Photoshop to the nth degree.  In the case of my image, most voters felt it met the challenge.  I do see the low votes, which evidently represent those who wanted to see an artificial silhouette.</td>', 'Originally posted by Kroburg: Sorry Richard, I''m with Anita in this. Looking for a definition of a silhouette I found this on Wikipedia: A silhouette is the image of a person, animal, object or scene represented as a solid shape of a single color, usually black, its edges matching the outline of the subject. The interior of a silhouette is featureless, and the whole is typically presented on a light background, usually white, or none at all.. Maybe there are more definitions, but that does not make her comment ridiculous. I think she is entitled to say what she thinks, that''s the whole purpose of giving comments.Congrats with a beautiful image of these impressive elks and with the Yellow!  Your definition and Neat''s definition are much more narrow than intended by the original challenge description.   A natural looking silhouette is not often pure black, unless doctored in Photoshop to the nth degree.  In the case of my image, most voters felt it met the challenge.  I do see the low votes, which evidently represent those who wanted to see an artificial silhouette.', '2016-02-01 11:46:53.000000', NULL, 0),
