(7434024, 1174479, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> It would of looked awesome if it was darkened  a bit more,  I can see what the guys wearing which means it''s not a true silhouette. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>let''s make good photos instead of defining true Scotsmen</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: It would of looked awesome if it was darkened  a bit more,  I can see what the guys wearing which means it''s not a true silhouette.   let''s make good photos instead of defining true Scotsmen', '2016-02-01 17:22:52.000000', NULL, 0),
